---
layout: base.njk
title: Insights
permalink: /blog/
---
<section class="page-head"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">The journal</p><h1>Insights</h1><p class="lede">Puget Sound market notes, buyer and seller guides, and investing.</p></div></section>
<section class="section tight"><div class="wrap">
  {% if collections.posts.length %}
  <div class="grid three">{% for p in collections.posts %}<a class="post-tile" href="{{ p.url }}"><span class="label">{{ p.date | longDate }}</span><h3>{{ p.data.title }}</h3><p>{{ p.data.summary }}</p></a>{% endfor %}</div>
  {% else %}<div class="empty-state"><h2>First posts coming soon</h2></div>{% endif %}
</div></section>
